    {
      "id": "76aLVKSgo_kymIWEZFf5K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2837.479439276368,
      "y": 2003.8593237431642,
      "width": 894.0833129882812,
      "height": 495,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2117961608,
      "version": 341,
      "versionNonce": 245242504,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777757447344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Luego las soluciones en los reales para:\n(λ + 1)(λ - 1)(λ² + 1) = 0 implica:\n\nó (λ + 1) = 0 ó (λ - 1) = 0 ó (λ² + 1) = 0\n\n(λ + 1) = 0 => λ1 = -1\n(λ - 1) = 0 => λ2 = 1\n(λ² + 1) = 0 => Sin Solución en R\n \n=> Los autovalores de T en R son λ1 = -1 ^ λ2 = 1 \n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Luego las soluciones en los reales para:\n(λ + 1)(λ - 1)(λ² + 1) = 0 implica:\n\nó (λ + 1) = 0 ó (λ - 1) = 0 ó (λ² + 1) = 0\n\n(λ + 1) = 0 => λ1 = -1\n(λ - 1) = 0 => λ2 = 1\n(λ² + 1) = 0 => Sin Solución en R\n \n=> Los autovalores de T en R son λ1 = -1 ^ λ2 = 1 \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
