      "seed": 202415240,
      "version": 62,
      "versionNonce": 558591880,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777761692333,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Luego las soluciones en los complejos para:\n(λ + 1)(λ - 1)(λ² + 1) = 0 implica:\n\nó (λ + 1) = 0 ó (λ - 1) = 0 ó (λ² + 1) = 0\n\n(λ + 1) = 0 => λ1 = -1\n(λ - 1) = 0 => λ2 = 1\n(λ² + 1) = 0 => λ3 = i ^ λ4 = -i",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Luego las soluciones en los complejos para:\n(λ + 1)(λ - 1)(λ² + 1) = 0 implica:\n\nó (λ + 1) = 0 ó (λ - 1) = 0 ó (λ² + 1) = 0\n\n(λ + 1) = 0 => λ1 = -1\n(λ - 1) = 0 => λ2 = 1\n(λ² + 1) = 0 => λ3 = i ^ λ4 = -i",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
